      "en": "Besides, she is indeed my sister, the daughter of my father, but not the daughter of my mother; and she became my wife.",
      "ko": "또 그는 실로 나의 이복누이로서 내 처가 되었음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "3eeafbba13b34babfd8ab489726ff2f05bf6bd7297c2f20e3bb1a47bcf98db2b",
      "translation_text_hash": "2e0f0a640ccd7af2730e21967702f328904aa02ec69877c9986a81070cb40e6d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
